The project tier `probe` is the home registry, the core tier `booping` another one. The Overview's
callout, type cards and «Recently updated» count probe's records only; booping gets its own block
headed by its name with its own cards and callout. The sidebar counts probe's types and gives
booping its own group. A booping record shows `booping:rule/0001` in its crumbs, on its article
and in probe's relations; probe's record keeps its bare `rule/0001`, also in booping's backlinks.
The project root's own page `probe/index.html` redirects to the Overview.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      core:
        path: ~/core-specs
        namespace: booping
-- fixtures/home/core-specs/rule/0001-small-commits.md --
---
type: rule
title: Small commits
summary: A commit carries one concern.
status: accepted
updated_at: 2026-10-02
---

# Small commits
-- fixtures/home/core-specs/value/0001-small-steps.md --
---
type: value
title: Small steps
summary: Ship in small, reviewable steps.
kind: value
reviewed: 2026-10-01
---

# Small steps
